WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:23.271
Cat woke up.

2
00:00:23.272 --> 00:00:28.534
Tom was still at the moat.

3
00:00:28.535 --> 00:00:39.648
"Hmm . . . ," Cat thought.

4
00:00:39.649 --> 00:00:44.921
Splash! The crocodile dropped into the water.

5
00:00:44.922 --> 00:00:50.903
Tom watched it swim away with the crown.

6
00:00:50.904 --> 00:00:54.421
"Ha-ha!" Dirk laughed softly.

7
00:00:54.422 --> 00:00:59.309
"You're going to get thrown in the Grim Dungeon!"

8
00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.942
"Oh no!" Tom thought.

9
00:01:01.943 --> 00:01:07.536
"Not the Grim Dungeon!"

10
00:01:07.537 --> 00:01:17.131
The princess was still wailing. "My crown!"

11
00:01:17.132 --> 00:01:24.804
"Psst! Tom!" whispered a voice. "Over here!"

12
00:01:24.805 --> 00:01:28.377
Tom looked around.

13
00:01:28.378 --> 00:01:31.662
Cat was hiding near the palace!

14
00:01:31.663 --> 00:01:44.990
She waved to Tom. "Come here."

15
00:01:44.991 --> 00:01:53.902
"Now, now." Dirk patted the princess' shoulder.

16
00:01:53.903 --> 00:01:58.877
"We can get you a new royal crown."

17
00:01:58.878 --> 00:02:03.844
The princess sobbed.

18
00:02:03.845 --> 00:02:08.647
"But that one is very special."

19
00:02:08.648 --> 00:02:11.953
Tom hurried toward Cat.

20
00:02:11.954 --> 00:02:15.109
Then he blinked in surprise.

21
00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:20.251
Cat had the fishing rod and . . . the crown!

22
00:02:20.252 --> 00:02:23.085
"Wow!" said Tom.

23
00:02:23.086 --> 00:02:26.118
"How did you get the crown?"

24
00:02:26.119 --> 00:02:28.293
Cat shrugged.

25
00:02:28.294 --> 00:02:31.279
"I woke up and decided to go fishing.

26
00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.706
But I caught this instead."

27
00:02:33.707 --> 00:02:38.529
Tom hid the crown in his robe.

28
00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:41.338
He ran back to the moat.

29
00:02:41.339 --> 00:02:46.721
"Wait! Princess Mary!" Tom called.

30
00:02:46.722 --> 00:02:59.925
He waved his wand. Poof!

31
00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:03.813
"My royal crown!" the princess cried.

32
00:03:03.814 --> 00:03:07.260
"Oh, Tom," she said happily.

33
00:03:07.261 --> 00:03:12.251
"You're the best royal wizard ever!"

34
00:03:12.252 --> 00:03:16.684
Tom bowed. "Thank you, Princess."

35
00:03:16.685 --> 00:03:19.423
He put the crown back on her head.

36
00:03:19.424 --> 00:03:30.990
Everyone clapped—but Dirk.
